# 🧩 AI Agent Actions

RazorAI supports action-oriented AI interactions including:

| Action             | Purpose                                |
| ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |
| `ADD_TO_CART`      | Add a selected product                 |
| `CHECKOUT`         | Start checkout                         |
| `CHOOSE_ALL`       | Select all presented products          |
| `CHOOSE_VISIBLE`   | Select currently visible products      |
| `COMPARE_SELECTED` | Compare selected products              |
| `CHOOSE_SELECTED`  | Select specific products               |
| `MORE_INFO`        | Request more information               |
| `RESEARCH_AGAIN`   | Generate another recommendation/search |
| `SHOW_MORE`        | Display additional products            |
| `SELECT_PRODUCTS`  | Select products from recommendations   |

This action layer allows the AI to interact with the application instead of simply generating text.

