# 🔌 Main Backend APIs

## Categories

```text
GET  /api/categories
POST /api/categories
```

## Products

```text
GET    /api/products
POST   /api/products
PUT    /api/products/{id}
DELETE /api/products/{id}

GET /api/products/search?name=...
GET /api/products/category/{categoryId}
```

## Cart

```text
GET    /api/cart/{userId}
POST   /api/cart/{userId}/items
PUT    /api/cart/items/{cartItemId}
DELETE /api/cart/items/{cartItemId}
```

## Orders

```text
POST /api/orders/{userId}
GET  /api/orders/{id}
GET  /api/orders/user/{userId}

PUT /api/orders/{orderId}/cancel
PUT /api/orders/{orderId}/cancel-paid
```

## Payments

```text
POST /api/payment/create/{orderId}
POST /api/payment/verify
```

## Reviews

```text
POST /api/reviews
GET  /api/reviews/product/{productId}
GET  /api/reviews/user/{userId}
```

## AI

```text
POST /api/ai/chat?userId={userId}
```

Example request:

```json
{
  "message": "Show me a wireless gaming headset under 4000",
  "action": "",
  "productIds": []
}
```

---

# 🗄️ Database

RazorAI uses PostgreSQL with the following main entities:

```text
Category
   │
   └── Product
          │
          ├── Review
          ├── CartItem
          └── OrderItem

Cart
   │
   └── CartItem

Order
   │
   ├── OrderItem
   └── Payment
```

Hibernate automatically manages the database schema using:

```properties
spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update
```

---

# 🔒 Security & Payment Design

RazorAI follows several important principles:

### API secrets stay server-side

Gemini and Razorpay secret keys are stored as environment variables and are never exposed to the React application.

### Payment verification happens on the backend

The frontend does not decide whether a payment succeeded.

The backend verifies the Razorpay payment signature before marking an order as paid.

### User-controlled payment

The AI can assist with product selection and checkout initiation, but the actual payment authorization remains with the user.

### Failed payments do not destroy the cart

If payment fails, the order remains pending and the cart can be retained for another attempt.

