# 📊 Why RazorAI is Agentic

RazorAI is designed around an agent loop:

```text
          ┌───────────────┐
          │     Intent    │
          └───────┬───────┘
                  ↓
          ┌───────────────┐
          │    Reason     │
          └───────┬───────┘
                  ↓
          ┌───────────────┐
          │     Tool      │
          │     Action    │
          └───────┬───────┘
                  ↓
          ┌───────────────┐
          │    Observe    │
          └───────┬───────┘
                  ↓
          ┌───────────────┐
          │    Continue   │
          └───────────────┘
```

Instead of:

```text
User → Question → AI → Text
```

RazorAI aims for:

```text
User
 ↓
Intent
 ↓
AI Reasoning
 ↓
Application Tool
 ↓
Real Action
 ↓
Updated State
 ↓
Next Decision
```

That distinction is central to the project's agentic-commerce design.

