# ⭐ Project Vision

RazorAI explores a simple idea:

> **What if shopping started with intent instead of a search box?**

Instead of making customers navigate:

```text
Search → Filters → Product Page → Cart → Checkout → Payment
```

RazorAI aims to provide:

```text
"Find me the right product."
            ↓
        AI Agent
            ↓
     Discover + Compare
            ↓
       Recommend
            ↓
       Add to Cart
            ↓
        Checkout
            ↓
        Payment
```

The long-term vision is an e-commerce experience where **AI becomes the interface between customer intent and commerce**, while payment actions remain controlled, explainable, and user-authorized.

